  "content": "<h1>玩家动画库，</h1><h2>使用关键帧为玩家制作动画。</h2><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric版本</a></strong><br>\n<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator/files?gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge版本</a></strong></p><p>对于用户/整合包开发者，只需将jar文件放入mods文件夹即可。</p><p>对于Mod开发者，您可以在此处找到更多详情：<a href=\"https://github.com/KosmX/fabricPlayerAnimation\" rel=\"nofollow\">KosmX/PlayerAnimator</a></p><p>它可能会使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bendy-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">bendy-lib</a>来获得更优质的动画效果。</p><h2>这是一个<strong>库</strong>，它本身不会执行任何操作。</h2><h2>1.19.2版本<strong>不</strong>兼容1.19.3版本</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9550\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.3版本</a></p><h2>开发相关问题：</h2><p>如有开发相关问题，请通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fx22jkxRpsD\" rel=\"nofollow\">Emotecraft Discord</a>或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fmatrix.kosmx.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Matrix</a>联系我。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
